  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Intransitive ({自動詞|じどうし}). Uses に particle for cause: {痛|いた}みに{悶|もだ}える.\n\nCONJUGATION: Ichidan verb: {悶|もだ}えない, {悶|もだ}えます, {悶|もだ}えて, {悶|もだ}えれば.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {痛|いた}み/{苦|くる}しみに{悶|もだ}える (to writhe in pain/agony)\n- {恋|こい}/{嫉妬|しっと}に{悶|もだ}える (to be tormented by love/jealousy)\n- {悶|もだ}え{苦|くる}しむ (to suffer in agony - compound verb)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {身悶|みもだ}える (to writhe - emphasizes whole body)\n- {苦|くる}しむ (to suffer - more general)\n- {悩|なや}む (to worry, be troubled - less intense)",
